#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut14_task
#! fresh   /tmp/figure-studio
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  220
#! poster  150
# the fine case (900 x 600 nodes, a 7 MB field.dat) dropped on the window: the Result panel shows the task's progress
# while it reads, then the field, drawn from a coarse copy; the 3-D tab shows the same copy (the reading runs in real
# time: the frames that show its progress depend on the machine)
0   wait
0   move 600 300
20  move 700 300 10
40  drop 700 300 /tmp/figure-studio/fine
100 wait
120 move 1000 620 20
170 move 513 31 15
185 down
187 up
200 move 800 400 10
